<title>FRANCE: Pathe 1996 sales rise 68 percent.</title>
<headline>Pathe 1996 sales rise 68 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover  1,841    vs    1,093</p>
<p>NOTE - Pathe, the media company created out of the break up of the Chargeurs holding company last year, published its sales figures in the official bulletin BALO. It said the 1995 figure was restated to take account of the 1996 split of Chargeurs into Pathe, which holds Chargeurs' 30.29 percent stake in BSkyB and Chargeurs International. -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
